## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Reticle|r 1.0.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: A stylish, high-visibility reticle. Six designs with a dark outline that reads on any background, colour by what you look at, a lock-on and open motion, hit and kill markers, and a preview on a dark and a light background in the settings.
